+# Billing disputes
+
+`classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts` classifies a message containing the exact lowercase text `refund` as `refund-review`. It classifies every other message as `invoice-question`.
+
+For refund and invoice questions, apply that classification as written. The classification does not establish approval, denial, payment status, or invoice details; state none of those without additional project evidence.

